ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com?@evil.net/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
SELECT pg_whitelist_test_check_url('https://good.example.com#@evil.net/page', false);
ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com#@evil.net/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
SELECT pg_whitelist_test_check_url('https://good.example.com?q=1@evil.net/page', false);
ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com?q=1@evil.net/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
SELECT pg_whitelist_test_check_url('https://good.example.com?q=1/@not-a-host', false);
 pg_whitelist_test_check_url 
-----------------------------
