ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com.evil.net/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
SELECT pg_whitelist_test_check_url('https://good.example.com@evil.net/page', false);
ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com@evil.net/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
