ERROR:  permission denied to access "https://good.example.com:8443/page"
DETAIL:  whitelist does not permit this file or URL for the current role.
SELECT pg_whitelist_test_check_url('https://other.example.com/api/v1', false);
 pg_whitelist_test_check_url 
